- {!page-glossary}: the terms of Silica.

{1:libraries Libraries}

Package [silica]:

- {!Silica}: the core. Machines, components, views, commands, routes, codecs.
- {!Silica_browser}: the browser platform ([silica.browser], Melange only).
  The host runtime itself is {!Silica.Runtime}; it reaches a platform only
  through {!Silica.Platform.t}.
- {!Silica_memory}: an in-memory platform for tests on native OCaml
  ([silica.memory]): the same runtime, a manual clock, requests and sockets
  that the test answers.
- {!Silica_server}: the server logic, with an adapter for each HTTP library
  ([silica.server], native only).
- {!Check}: the model checker ([silica.check]).
- {!Silica_jsonkit}: codecs from [jsonkit] ([silica.jsonkit], native only).
  The package [silica-jsonkit-melange] has the same module for Melange.
- {!Silica_json}: the JSON value that the codecs use ([silica.json]).

Package [silica-ui]: headless components after Base UI, such as dialog, menu,
select and tooltip, and the theme API. See {!page-ui}.
